Package: bayesim
Title: Simulation Framework for Bayesian Modeling
Version: 2.0.0
URL: https://sims1253.github.io/bayesim/, https://github.com/sims1253/bayesim
BugReports: https://github.com/sims1253/bayesim/issues
Authors@R: c(
    person("Maximilian", "Scholz", , "research.scholz@mailbox.org", 
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Paul-Christian", "Bürkner", , "paul.buerkner@gmail.com", 
           role = "aut")
  )
Author: Maximilian Scholz [aut, cre], Paul-Christian Bürkner [aut]
Maintainer: Maximilian Scholz <research.scholz@mailbox.org>
Description: A framework for designing and running simulation studies of
    Bayesian models: parameter recovery, calibration checking via
    simulation-based calibration, model comparison, and method evaluation.
    Studies are declared as grids of data-generating conditions, models, and
    replicates, and executed with deterministic reproducibility,
    checkpoint/resume support, and bounded memory use. Extensible with
    custom fitters, metrics, and data generators.
